%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: MonikaAndMaroDealsWithTheDarkBrotherhood
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756636
    - rid: 4972360592123756637
    - rid: 4972360592123756650
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess this is <i>the</i> Dragon Bridge.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756638
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I can't believe some punk bandit tried to attack me on the way  here-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756639
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess I'm lucky that she was alone and was scared off by just my outfit...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756640
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756641
    - rid: 4972360592123756642
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Excuse me, which building is the Penitus Oculatus' headquarters in?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756643
    - rid: 4972360592123756644
    - rid: 4972360592123756646
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41bdf284be23a1c429ceb699bc93613d, type: 2}
    dialog: You've got business with them?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756647
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41bdf284be23a1c429ceb699bc93613d, type: 2}
    dialog: It's that building right there, the one with the Imperial banners hung
      up on it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756648
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360592123756649
    - rid: 4972360592123756651
    - rid: 4972360592123756652
    - rid: 7856102979522003012
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Haahh... are they just letting anyone in here?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379444
    - rid: 4972360613912379445
    - rid: 4972360613912379446
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Fine, what do you want citizen-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh! That outfit... Aren't you the guard captain of Whiterun?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379447
    - rid: 4972360613912379448
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379449
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Well then, what brings you here?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379450
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379451
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika recounts her investigation. Again...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379453
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: 'This time with new information from {mc}: the primary suspect is a member
      of the Dark Brotherhood.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379454
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: You say that the Thalmor are employing the Dark Brotherhood, hm?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379455
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Like <i>that's</i> what we need right now, gods...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379456
    - rid: 4972360613912379458
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: You certainly came to the right place-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379457
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: We've actually been investigating the Dark Brotherhood presence in Skyrim
      for a bit now...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379459
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Ever since the alleged death of the Listener just over a decade ago-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: The Brotherhood has, thankfully, been far less active.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: While it's fortunate that less people have to meet an untimely end-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: It does make the job of tracking them down that much harder.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360613912379470
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: We've been able to deduce that they seem to move around the most in the
      south-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522002944
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: However, we haven't been able to pin down their operations any further
      than that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522002945
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2376c82df69669342b30db689a8411f0, type: 2}
    dialog: Sir, sir!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522002946
    - rid: 7856102979522002947
    - rid: 7856102979522002948
    - rid: 7856102979522002949
    - rid: 7856102979522002950
    - rid: 7856102979522002951
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: What is it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522002952
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2376c82df69669342b30db689a8411f0, type: 2}
    dialog: We found their sanctuary! It's in Falkreath!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522002956
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Their sanctuary? Is that their base of operations?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522002954
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Indeed, where exactly is it in Falkreath?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522002957
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2376c82df69669342b30db689a8411f0, type: 2}
    dialog: It's directly between Falkreath city and Cracked Tusk Keep.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: And you're <i>sure</i> it's the sanctuary?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2376c82df69669342b30db689a8411f0, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course! I saw the bloody skull door and everything!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2376c82df69669342b30db689a8411f0, type: 2}
    dialog: It... it had a heartbeat...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522002958
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: That certainly matches some of the vague rumors we've noted...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you manage to catch anyone going through that door?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522002959
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2376c82df69669342b30db689a8411f0, type: 2}
    dialog: No sir, I rushed back here as soon as possible after confirming I wasn't
      just seeing things.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaahh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: So you didn't catch the password to enter, then...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Great.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003014
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Isn't that a bit harsh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003013
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yeah. Sorry.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003015
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Go on, then, lead us to it-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003016
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually, let me draft up a letter back to Cyrodiil, first.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Commander Maro takes a brief minute to write a brief report that will
      be sent to his superiors.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003017
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, I'll get this to a courier, and <i>then</i> you'll lead us to
      the sanctuary.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, us?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003018
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Is something the matter? I thought that...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003019
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: My apologies for my presumptiousness, but I thought that since you were
      still here-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: That you were assigned to help us by your Jarl.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003020
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, well, his words on the matter were that he would refrain from getting
      involved with <i>anything</i> Thalmor.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003021
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh... well.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003025
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: If you have other matters to attend to...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Honestly? I kinda don't.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003022
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: What exactly are we going to be doing when we get there?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003023
    - rid: 7856102979522003026
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: So you <i>are</i> coming along, then?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003024
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: First priority is noting down the exact location of the sanctuary and
      sending that information back-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Just in-case something goes... wrong.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003027
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Once that's dealt with, we'll be staking out the location.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003028
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: 'There are two high priority pieces of information that we''ll be looking
      for:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: 'First: how many members reside in the sanctuary?'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Second: what''s the password to gain entry into the sanctuary?'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: The purpose of knowing both of these should be self-explanatory.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003029
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: To know how many people to apprehend and how to get in to do it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003030
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... apprehend?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003031
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Ha! You're quite the optimist.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: I suppose if, by some miracle, we manage to properly secure any of them-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003033
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: We'd have them carted back to Cyrodiil and have them deal with that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: But I'm sure they'd rather us take care of it the simple, and hard, way.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: We are under specific instruction to <i>eliminate</i> them after all.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003034
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Which will likely be easier said than done.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003035
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Any other questions before we get moving?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003036
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, no, I guess not.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003037
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41a8ee15f11140840838dac560b7ed2b, type: 2}
    dialog: Good. <i>Now</i> let's move.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003038
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003039
    - rid: 7856102979522003040
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856102979522003041
